==Description==
The '''Cloudy Nametag''' is a {{Color|Legendary}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|5,000}}.

The '''Cloudy Nametag''' is very similar to the [[Default Nametag]], as it has white text and a black outline. However, it also has clouds appear behind it.

